{
  "id": "32905_yatsureru",
  "headword": "やつれる",
  "reading": "やつれる",
  "romaji": "yatsureru",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (ichidan)",
  "gloss": "to become haggard; to look worn out",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to become haggard; to look worn out or gaunt",
      "explanation": "To lose weight and look tired and drawn because of illness, worry, overwork or grief."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "32905_yatsureru_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦{少|すこ}し→少し：00596_sukoshi⟧やつれた⟦ね→ね：09474_ne⟧。",
      "english": "You look a bit worn out.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "32905_yatsureru_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{看病|かんびょう}→看病：16956_kanbyou⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧⟦{母|はは}→母：00549_haha⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧やつれてしまった。",
      "english": "Nursing the sick has left my mother looking haggard.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "32905_yatsureru_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{久|ひさ}しぶり→久しぶり：01711_hisashiburi⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{会|あ}った→会う：00482_au⟧⟦{友人|ゆうじん}→友人：03649_yuujin⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧、⟦{仕事|しごと}→仕事：00480_shigoto⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{心労|しんろう}⟦で→で：00502_de⟧⟦すっかり→すっかり：01270_sukkari⟧やつれて⟦いた→いる：00495_iru⟧。",
      "english": "The friend I met after a long time looked completely worn down by stress at work.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Written {窶|やつ}れる in kanji, but kana is usual. Mostly in the て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ or た form, describing the state.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{顔|かお}→顔：00558_kao⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧やつれる: one's face becomes gaunt\n- ⟦{病気|びょうき}→病気：00771_byouki⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧やつれる: to waste away from illness\n- やつれた⟦{顔|かお}→顔：00558_kao⟧: a haggard face\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{痩|や}せる→痩せる：01146_yaseru⟧: to lose weight, neutral or even positive; やつれる adds a tired, unhealthy look",
